alternatives: A 3 mm floor with the same recess raises the equipment face by 0.75 mm; keeping that face instead leaves the screw heads 0.60 mm proud. Shallower head pockets lose the recessed head/driver envelope. Moving the shared clamp stations changes both closures and the shell hosts.
