[sliver] R1.5 pump-spring root clearance: this 1.25 mm horizontal step is the difference between the spring-root relief and the catch neck. The relief includes 0.25 mm running allowance around the 2 mm leaf root while the deeper pocket retains the full 2.60 mm caught bearing. Both mouths open along the complete cap length.
alternatives: Filling the root relief interferes with the R1.5 fillet. Carrying the relief through the whole pocket removes part of the caught bearing; narrowing the fillet changes the selected spring root.
file: hardware/printed-parts/cold-core/foam-cap/foam-cap-lid-top.step
