[ceiling] Functional v3 pump catch roofs: each 55 mm face projects 2.85 mm for the 2.60 mm catch and 0.25 mm running allowance, above the 3.5 mm-high pocket. Receiver walls and axial bearing lands retain 3 mm stock. Tree(auto)/Default places small model-rooted supports in these outward-open flank pockets; remove them through the flank before fitting the pump and separate cap. Physical cleanup and release force remain unqualified.
alternatives: Sloping the roof supplies a withdrawal ramp; filling the pocket blocks the hook. Reducing its reach reduces the specified capture. More vertical stock does not change this fitted horizontal bearing.
file: hardware/printed-parts/cold-core/foam-cap/foam-cap-lid-top.step
