[ceiling] Functional aft paired-seat tie passage: the 3.2 mm-wide open tunnel has 1.575 mm clear height and a full 3 mm roof under the tube-bearing ridge. Its broad transition joins both tube grooves. The current slice bridges across the short X width with complete anchors on both sides and no support inside the passage.
alternatives: Opening the roof cuts the tube-bearing ridge; filling the tunnel prevents the tie from passing. A corbel into the passage reduces the selected tie clearance.
